      "content": "it's not just people standing by me though. it's the shame. everyone thinks i'm this successful guy and now i'm just this joke. the idea of having to walk into a room and see the pity or the \"i told you so\" looks in their eyes... i can't do it. i'd rather just not be there at all. it feels more like a loss of self than a loss of money.",
